@startuml Led
title ESP32 LED Testprojekt

actor User
participant "ESP32" as ESP32
participant "LED-Module" as LED
participant "PlatformIO" as PIO

User -> PIO: Projekt öffnen
PIO -> ESP32: Code kompilieren
PIO -> ESP32: Firmware hochladen
ESP32 -> LED: Datenpin (GPIO 5)
ESP32 -> LED: Stromversorgung (VCC/GND)
ESP32 -> LED: LED ansteuern
LED --> User: Licht sichtbar

note right of LED
  Voraussetzung:
  - richtige LED-Art (z.B. WS2812B / NeoPixel)
  - GND gemeinsam
  - VCC korrekt
  - Datenleitung an GPIO 5
  - ggf. 330Ω Widerstand
end note

@enduml